<title>USA: Tecumseh Products Co Q1 net up, sales off.</title>
<headline>Tecumseh Products Co Q1 net up, sales off.</headline>
<dateline>TECUMSEH, Mich. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net Sales					 $479.6	  $496.2</p>
<p>   Cost of sales and operating expenses   407.3	   426.3</p>
<p>   Selling and administrative expenses     27.0	    24.9</p>
<p> Operating Income				  45.3	    45.0</p>
<p>   Interest expense			     (1.4)	   (1.9)</p>
<p>   Interest income and other, net	     4.9	     5.1</p>
<p> Income Before Taxes on Income		 48.8	    48.2</p>
<p>   Taxes On Income				 17.3	    17.2</p>
<p> Net Income					  31.5	    31.0</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			    1.44	    1.42</p>
<p> Cash Dividends Declared Per Share	   0.30	    0.26</p>
<p>	 (Figures in millions except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Certain amounts previously reported have been reclassified to conform with the current presentation.</p>
<p>Continued lagging sales in European markets and decreased demand for room air conditioning in the U.S. were the major contributors to the 1997 first quarter sales decline.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
